							from : "zoho.loginuserid"
							to : "zoho.adminuserid"
							subject : "Record Added or Updated${Item_Name}     Price Change Request Raised"
							message : "<p><b>Dear</b> <i>sir,</i><br></p><p>We hope this message finds you well.<br></p><p>We are writing to inform you that a request has been made to update the pricing of one or more items on your restaurant's menu. Below are the details of the requested price changes:<br></p><div><br><table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"2\" cellpadding=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: DejaVuSans, sans-serif; border: 1px solid black; color: black;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Market Name</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Brand Name</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Item Name</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Current Price</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>New Price</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Requested By</b><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><b>Effective Date</b><br></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div>${Market_Lookup}<br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div>${Brand_Lookup}<br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div>${Item_Name}<br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div>${Current_Price}<br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 51, 51)\" class=\"colour\">${New_Price}</span><br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div>${Added_User}<br></div></td><td style=\"width: 63px;\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 51, 51)\" class=\"colour\">${Effective_Date}</span><br></div></td></tr></tbody></table><br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>"
						)
					}
				}

